ng an antitrust enforcement action over NVIDIA's Groq arrangement? [88, 101, 105]\nM26 False EU regulatory review of the Hugging Face acquisition By January 31, 2027, what stage will EU regulatory review of NVIDIA's Hugging Face acquisition have reached? [398]\nM27 False NVIDIA Hugging Face acquisition obligation at FY2027 year-end How much of NVIDIA's agreed Hugging Face acquisition obligation remains outstanding at FY2027 year-end? [3, 9, 20, 277, 398]\nM28 False U.S. antitrust review of the Hugging Face acquisition By January 31, 2027, what stage will U.S. antitrust review of NVIDIA's Hugging Face acquisition have reached? [398]\nM29 False Marvell FY2028 revenue What will Marvell's total revenue be in FY2028? [58, 181, 366, 377]\nM30 True NVIDIA FY2028 Vera CPU revenue How much revenue will NVIDIA generate from Vera CPUs in FY2028? [72, 148]\nM31 False NVIDIA AI cloud partner guarantee obligations at FY2027 year-end / NVIDIA total third-party guarantees and credit support for cloud/AI partners in the FY2027 10-K (vs up to $108.5B) How much will NVIDIA report in guarantee obligations tied to AI cloud partners in its FY2027 annual report? [51, 57, 61, 118, 126, 128, 254, 255, 320]\nM32 False NVIDIA neocloud capacity commitments at FY2027 year-end / NVIDIA cloud-service/neocloud capacity commitments, take-or-pay and revenue-floor backstops in the FY2027 10-K (vs $36B) How much will NVIDIA's outstanding neocloud cloud-service commitments total at FY2027 year-end? [126, 186, 187, 193, 247, 403]\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/reading-diagnostic/mapping-out/map-L6-claude.txt:2:{\"matter\": \"M02\", \"status\": \"narrower\", \"ids\": [\"Q6\"], \"main_outcome\": false, \"note\": \"Q6 covers only four hyperscalers' 2026 data-center capex, not the five-company total.\"}\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/reading-diagnostic/mapping-out/map-L6-claude.txt:3:{\"matter\": \"M03\", \"status\": \"narrower\", \"ids\": [\"Q7\"], \"main_outcome\": false, \"note\": \"Q7 covers only four