, D27, D29, D41, D47, D51, D356, D190, D364) | §4 Config |\n385:| D40 | 2026-10-20 | The matching judge: a general model first, every match recorded, humans label, a small model later | in force (amended by D42, D44, D45, D46, D169, D190) | §7 Thesis library |\n386:| D41 | 2026-10-20 | What the rebuilt views database changes outside it | in force (amended by D42, D45, D51, D54, D190, D191, D195, D356, D374) | §4 Config |\n389:| D44 | 2026-10-20 | Matching is the model's alone: no key matched by code | superseded by D45, D58, D153, D155, D169, D197 | Thesis library |\n391:| D46 | 2026-10-20 | Alex decides Claude's views proposals one by one | in force (amended by D51, D54, D58, D63, D155, D169, D185, D191, D197, D198, D202, D204) | §7 Thesis library |\n392:| D47 | 2026-10-20 | End-to-end consistency from the universe to the views database | in force (amended by D52, D163, D169, D190) | §7 Thesis library |\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-hybrid/PLAN.md:12:| A policy removed matters by construction (company figures, D382), and it was known only at the end | D676 | Alex decides the figure questions for the hybrid now (below) |\ndocs/research/2026-11-20-hybrid/PLAN.md:34:- **If D382 applies to the hybrid** (no company-figure questions), old keeps 5–6 matters the hybrid cannot serve, and the hybrid loses by\ndocs/research/2026-11-19-merge-council/RESULT.md:119:  - M30 is a company figure (D382/D505).\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
