{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"agent_message","text":"**Fix the census before treating its ceiling as a product limit.** Some missing questions fit Alex’s existing rules.\n\n- **Causes.** The five-company capex candidates really merged under D197. M07, M12 and M20 had no matching proposal in the trace. FY2028 Data Center revenue can diverge from total revenue, and signing a guarantee can diverge from its year-end balance. D248 allows separate questions when an analyst would bet on each outcome. M20 asks whether a specific agreement gets signed. An aggregate support balance cannot settle it. The trace counts links by article, so it cannot establish that the decisive facts were kept. [Opening trace](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/poc/data/hybrid-2026-11-20/opening-census.json:830) · [D248](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2959)\n- **Company scope.** NVIDIA-only tagging explains four misses involving companies already on the research list. Marvell also needs admission to that list. D187 assigns a company’s figures to that company. It does not require NVIDIA-only coverage. [D187](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:2480)\n- **Ceiling.** The named opportunities total up to seven gross gains, or five with the judge paused. The generous scenario can clear five arithmetically. Neither establishes a lead: D665 requires five net gains and at least twice as many wins as losses. [OPENING-CENSUS.md:22](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-11-20-hybrid/OPENING-CENSUS.md:22) · [D665](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/DECISIONS-log.md:9414)\n- **Ask Alex about D382 first.** Should company figures serve only as evidence, or can a material, separately answerable figure get its own forecast when an analyst can explain why it matters? Recommend the latter to preserve useful forecasts the old system already serves. Then compare one opening change against old in three paired runs, with blind readers scoring supported final answers on the frozen 32 matters under D665. Check that five net gains are attainable before sending.\n\nDISAGREE: Correct the cause counts, settle which company forecasts the hybrid should serve, and test one opening change on final answers."}}
